1
00:00:00,395 --> 00:00:02,225
(Sheldon:)Penny?
(grunts)

2
00:00:03,832 --> 00:00:05,832
(Penny:)Ugh, what?

3
00:00:05,834 --> 00:00:07,704
(Sheldon:)You sounded in distress.

4
00:00:07,703 --> 00:00:09,333
(Sheldon:)I was worried something
unpleasant was happening to you.

5
00:00:09,338 --> 00:00:11,168
(Sheldon:)Like a murder.

6
00:00:11,173 --> 00:00:13,803
(Sheldon:)Or spontaneous coitus
with Leonard.

7
00:00:15,844 --> 00:00:17,174
(Penny:)Oh, I'm just doing
this awful workout.

8
00:00:17,179 --> 00:00:18,509
(Penny:)I hate it.

9
00:00:18,513 --> 00:00:21,013
(Sheldon:)Well, if you hate it,
then why are you doing it?

10
00:00:21,016 --> 00:00:22,686
(Sheldon:)Although I could ask
the same question

11
00:00:22,684 --> 00:00:24,514
(Sheldon:)about coitus with Leonard.

12
00:00:24,519 --> 00:00:27,359
(Penny:)I don't know-- I guess
I like that I hate it.

13
00:00:27,356 --> 00:00:28,886
(Penny:)It makes me work harder.

14
00:00:28,890 --> 00:00:30,690
(Sheldon:)And to clarify...

15
00:00:30,692 --> 00:00:32,322
(Penny:)The exercise, Sheldon.

16
00:00:33,895 --> 00:00:35,865
(Penny:)Shouldn't you be getting
ready for work?

17
00:00:35,864 --> 00:00:37,194
(Sheldon:)I'm not going.

18
00:00:37,199 --> 00:00:38,729
(Sheldon:)Would you like to know why?

19
00:00:38,734 --> 00:00:41,364
(Penny:)Uh, you're sad about not getting
anything done last night,

20
00:00:41,370 --> 00:00:43,470
(Penny:)so you're gonna sit around
and pout about it?

21
00:00:44,873 --> 00:00:47,273
(Sheldon:)Boy, I'm not nearly as
mysterious as I think I am.

22
00:00:49,578 --> 00:00:50,878
(Howard:)I invented a game.

23
00:00:50,879 --> 00:00:52,549
(Howard:)You want to play?
Sure.

24
00:00:52,547 --> 00:00:54,947
(Howard:)It's called
"Emily or Cinnamon?"

25
00:00:54,950 --> 00:00:58,390
(Howard:)I give you actual quotes
I've heard Raj say,

26
00:00:58,387 --> 00:01:06,027
(Howard:)and you guess if he was talking
to his girlfriend or his dog.

